description:
In repos/development-vessel/src/resolvers/feature-compose.ts, attribute a compose's outcome to the model that actually DRAFTED it rather than to whichever completion happened last. THREE edits in this one file.

Edit 1 declares the variable. Replace this comment line, which occurs exactly once:
// arm's outcome once its verdict is known.

with exactly:
// arm's outcome once the compose verdict is settled. planDraftModel pins the PLAN
// call's model, which is the one that actually authored the patch.
let planDraftModel = "";

Edit 2 captures the plan call's model. Replace these two consecutive lines, which occur exactly once, leaving BOTH unchanged and inserting one new line between them:
      planRaw = await llmCallWithFailover(llmEndpoints, decomposePrompt(spec, maxOps, grounding, principles + composeLessons, priorFeedback, netNewTargets), model);
    } catch (e) {

with exactly:
      planRaw = await llmCallWithFailover(llmEndpoints, decomposePrompt(spec, maxOps, grounding, principles + composeLessons, priorFeedback, netNewTargets), model);
      planDraftModel = lastDraftModel;
    } catch (e) {

Edit 3 reports it, preferring the plan model. Replace this line, which occurs exactly once:
          model: lastDraftModel,

with exactly:
          model: planDraftModel || lastDraftModel,

Why: every completion in this file goes through the same llmCall with task_type feature_compose - spec refine, plan decompose, anchor re-derivation, blind-edit repair, created-file rewrite, lint repair, and the semantic-gate judge. lastDraftModel therefore holds the LAST completion, and since the judge runs after drafting, the arm being graded is usually the judge rather than the drafter. Measured: 141 drafting-pick lines across roughly 34 composes, about four completions each. Capturing immediately after the plan-decomposition call pins the model that authored the patch; the fallback keeps behaviour unchanged when no plan call ran.

The ONLY new declaration is planDraftModel in edit 1. Do NOT redeclare planRaw, lastDraftModel, model, verdict or METABOB_API_KEY. Do NOT modify any numeric literal.

